{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/48647-bite-of-the-wooden-fang-for-gmc","id":48647,"title":"Bite of the Wooden Fang for GMC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-13T19:02:09-08:00","id":48647,"title":"Bite of the Wooden Fang for GMC","content":"Since all weapons do Lethal in GMC, I'm pondering what needs to be done about this Clause of the Contract. Right now I'm drawing a blank, and poking about to see if anyone has any suggestions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Shok ebasit hissra. Meraad astaarit, meraad itwasit, aban aqun. Maraas shokra. Anaan esaam Qun.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/710-veddhartha","name":"Veddhartha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar710_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T20:33:03-08:00","id":48688,"title":"","content":"The option is to let it add to either the chance to hit with a weapon (which is helpful, but less thematic) or the chance to add directly to damage inflicted by weapons, or improve it to inflict tilts in combat. As under the old NWOD rules, there was no real separation between the two.<br /> <br /> As for how I'd go with it? Grant extra weapon damage and give the weapon the ability to inflict some kind of tilts. Stunned? Poisoned?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T00:50:46-08:00","id":48784,"title":"","content":"Add extra damage instead of dices. You'd probably want not to make it stun, because it's already a powerful weapon with enough suxx and with a simple 1 level clause. Poisoned is probably better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}